        'Yes, anywhere in the day: the button “A stop of your own” at the head of the day puts it at the end, and the + between two stops puts it exactly there. You choose how long it takes and whether it stays at the previous stop, has no particular place, or is somewhere else; the drive and the times are recalculated.' => '',      // plan.php
